---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="When to Seek Medical Help for Flu — Emergency Warning Signs"
  description="Know when flu symptoms require immediate medical attention. Emergency warning signs for adults, children, and high-risk groups. When to see a doctor vs. go to the ER."
>
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <header class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-red-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Emergency Guide</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-navy-900 mt-2 mb-4">
        When Flu Symptoms Require Medical Attention
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        Most flu cases resolve at home — but complications can be serious. Learn the warning signs that demand immediate action.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Emergency banner -->
    <div class="callout-emergency mb-12 text-center">
      <p class="text-lg">🚨 <strong>If you or someone you're caring for has difficulty breathing, chest pain, confusion, or bluish lips/face — call 911 (US) or 112 (EU) immediately.</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <a href="/when-to-seek-help/emergency-warning-signs/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-red-200 hover:border-red-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🚨</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-red-600 transition-colors">Emergency Warning Signs</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">The critical symptoms that mean you should go to the ER immediately. For adults and children.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-red-600 font-medium text-sm">Know the signs →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/when-to-seek-help/when-to-see-doctor/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🩺</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">When to See a Doctor</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Not an emergency but worth a visit. Symptoms that warrant a doctor's evaluation and what to expect.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Learn more →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/when-to-seek-help/high-risk-groups/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">⚠️</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">High-Risk Groups</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Who is at highest risk for flu complications? Pregnant women, elderly, children, and chronic conditions.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Check risk factors →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/when-to-seek-help/telehealth-for-flu/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">💻</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Telehealth for Flu</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">When a virtual visit is appropriate. What telehealth can and can't do for flu symptoms.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Explore options →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
